cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: mneme
abstract: >-
  Vault-native memory plugin for Claude Code, Codex, and Antigravity.
  Markdown is the
  source of truth and the index is a rebuildable artifact. Ships SQLite
  FTS5 BM25 retrieval with an RRF-ready architecture, opt-in background
  compression with a cost cap, and a gated Graphiti knowledge graph.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Impram
    given-names: Onour
repository-code: "https://github.com/OnourImpram/mneme"
url: "https://github.com/OnourImpram/mneme"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 3.6.3
date-released: "2026-07-27"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21631389"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21631389"
    description: >-
      Concept DOI. Resolves to the most recent archived version.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21631390"
    description: >-
      Version DOI for 3.6.3.
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.20674727"
    description: >-
      Concept DOI of the earlier archive series, which ends at 3.1.0. Zenodo
      opened a new series rather than continuing this one when the GitHub
      archiving hook was re-enabled, so it is recorded here rather than
      dropped: anything that already cites it still resolves, but it will not
      advance past 3.1.0. Releases from 3.6.3 onward are archived under
      10.5281/zenodo.21631389.
keywords:
